# Held awake with the lid shut and forgotten in a bag. Heat is the danger in there:
# at critical temperature awake gives up the lid, forced or not, and the Mac sleeps.
# And if the bag stays cool, the battery floor ends it with charge to spare.
clock 22:10 · battery 41 · floor 15

key
lid close
caption "Forgot it was on, lid shut, in a bag?"
time +25m · thermal critical
caption "If it gets too hot, awake lets it sleep."
lid open
thermal nominal
key
lid close
time +3h05m · battery 15
caption "If the battery runs low, it sleeps too."
lid open
